{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Welcome To Willbey School, A Place Once Known For Education And Joy.. Or Was It?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Peek a Doom</strong> is a <strong>first-person horror adventure</strong> set in the shadowy halls of Willby School. You play as <strong>Peter</strong>, a determined brother searching for his  missing sister in a place where reality bends, and every corner hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve twisted puzzles, sneak through the darkness, and uncover a chilling mystery that goes deeper than anyone dares to admit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/welcome_to_willbye_school.gif?t=1752156518\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/line.png?t=1752156518\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Explore the Darkness</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through Willby's eerie classrooms, abandoned hallways, and off-limits zones as you solve the puzzles and piece together the truth behind your sister\u2019s abduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/explore_darkness.gif?t=1752156518\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/line.png?t=1752156518\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <i>Uncover The Cult</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/extras/uncover_cult.gif?t=1752156518\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the secret history of the school, the dark forces pulling the strings behind the scenes, and avoid being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374710?t=1752156518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/af27927227f9f9adc77559a51ba3cd746cc4125a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752156518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/557f232bd25c1037b552cfa7a83410ace00a730b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752156518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374710/557f232bd25c1037b552cfa7a83410ace00a730b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752156518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i>Welcome To Willbey School, A Place Once Known For Education And Joy.. Or Was It?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Peek a Doom</strong> is a <strong>first-person horror adventure</strong> set in the shadowy halls of Willby School. You play as <strong>Peter</strong>, a determined brother searching for his  missing sister in a place where reality bends, and every corner hides a secret.</